{"id":"faf5ed362af8d3bf","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/089_ε-演算_Hilbert_ε-calculus.md","title":"089 ε-演算 Hilbert ε-calculus","display":"089_ε-演算_Hilbert_ε-calculus","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令一阶签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。新变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义。构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var,\\quad fun,\\quad eps,\\quad rel,\\quad eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var,\\quad fun,\\quad eps,\\quad rel,\\quad eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项与公式的同时形成\">2. 项与公式的同时形成</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 与公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小二元组：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eps(x,A)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(eps(x,A)\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Rel\">\\(R\\in Rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R(R)=n\">\\(ar_R(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(rel(R,\\tau)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon x\\,A\">\\(\\varepsilon x\\,A\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eps(x,A)\">\\(eps(x,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>ε 绑定项集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"EpsTerm_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{eps(x,A):x\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[EpsTerm_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{eps(x,A):x\\in Var,\\ A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量\">3. 自由变量</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T:Tm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\">\\(FV_T:Tm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\)</span> 与公式自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F:Frm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\">\\(FV_F:Frm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\)</span> 同时由下列方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(eps(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(eps(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^\\varepsilon:Tm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nBV_F^\\varepsilon:Frm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^\\varepsilon:Tm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nBV_F^\\varepsilon:Frm_\\varepsilon\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^\\varepsilon(var(x))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^\\varepsilon(var(x))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^\\varepsilon(fun(f,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}BV_T^\\varepsilon(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^\\varepsilon(fun(f,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}BV_T^\\varepsilon(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^\\varepsilon(eps(x,A))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^\\varepsilon(eps(x,A))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^\\varepsilon(rel(R,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}BV_T^\\varepsilon(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^\\varepsilon(rel(R,\\tau))\n=\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}BV_T^\\varepsilon(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^\\varepsilon(eq(s,t))\n=\nBV_T^\\varepsilon(s)\\cup BV_T^\\varepsilon(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^\\varepsilon(eq(s,t))\n=\nBV_T^\\varepsilon(s)\\cup BV_T^\\varepsilon(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^\\varepsilon(neg(A))=BV_F^\\varepsilon(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^\\varepsilon(neg(A))=BV_F^\\varepsilon(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^\\varepsilon(imp(A,B))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup BV_F^\\varepsilon(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^\\varepsilon(imp(A,B))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup BV_F^\\varepsilon(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^\\varepsilon(all(x,A))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^\\varepsilon(all(x,A))\n=\nBV_F^\\varepsilon(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-无捕获替换\">4. 无捕获替换</h1>\n<p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^\\varepsilon:Tm_\\varepsilon\\times Var\\times Tm_\\varepsilon\\to Tm_\\varepsilon,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^\\varepsilon:Tm_\\varepsilon\\times Var\\times Tm_\\varepsilon\\to Tm_\\varepsilon,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^\\varepsilon:Frm_\\varepsilon\\times Var\\times Tm_\\varepsilon\\to Frm_\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^\\varepsilon:Frm_\\varepsilon\\times Var\\times Tm_\\varepsilon\\to Frm_\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^\\varepsilon(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^\\varepsilon(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^\\varepsilon(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^\\varepsilon(A,x,s)\\)</span>。非绑定构造子的条款为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rel(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对绑定项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eps(y,A)\">\\(eps(y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in FV_T(s)\">\\(y\\in FV_T(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eps(y,A)[x:=s]=eps(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)\">\\(all(y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in FV_T(s)\">\\(y\\in FV_T(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-alpha-等价\">5. alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon\n\\subseteq\n(Tm_\\varepsilon\\cup Frm_\\varepsilon)^2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon\n\\subseteq\n(Tm_\\varepsilon\\cup Frm_\\varepsilon)^2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交。</p>\n<p>首先 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\varepsilon\\cup Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(Tm_\\varepsilon\\cup Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 上的等价关系。并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 与各构造子相容：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in Fun\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n\\bigl(ar_F(f)=n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(fun(f,\\tau),fun(f,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in Fun\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n\\bigl(ar_F(f)=n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(fun(f,\\tau),fun(f,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\\in Rel\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n\\bigl(ar_R(R)=n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(rel(R,\\tau),rel(R,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R\\in Rel\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n\\bigl(ar_R(R)=n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(rel(R,\\tau),rel(R,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((s_0,t_0)\\in E\\land(s_1,t_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eq(s_0,s_1),eq(t_0,t_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((s_0,t_0)\\in E\\land(s_1,t_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eq(s_0,s_1),eq(t_0,t_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(neg(A),neg(B)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(neg(A),neg(B)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eps(x,A),eps(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eps(x,A),eps(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量改名生成条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eps(x,A),eps(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eps(x,A),eps(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-逻辑与等词公理\">6. 逻辑与等词公理</h1>\n<p>基础公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\">\\(Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是下列集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^\\varepsilon\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^\\varepsilon=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^\\varepsilon=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,t,u\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^\\varepsilon=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,t,u\\in Tm_\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-ε-公理集合\">7. ε 公理集合</h1>\n<p>ε 公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=eps(x,A)]):x\\in Var,\\ t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon,\\ A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=eps(x,A)]):x\\in Var,\\ t\\in Tm_\\varepsilon,\\ A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>ε 外延公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(all(x,imp(B,A)),eq(eps(x,A),eps(x,B)))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(all(x,imp(B,A)),eq(eps(x,A),eps(x,B)))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}=Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}=Ax_{base}^\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-规则与证明\">8. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^\\varepsilon=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^\\varepsilon=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_\\varepsilon,A\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 出发的证明是非空有限公式序列，每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\">\\(Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>由较早两行通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon\">\\(Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon\\)</span> 给出。</li>\n<li>由较早一行通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^\\varepsilon\">\\(Rule_\\forall^\\varepsilon\\)</span> 给出，且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>由较早一行通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon\">\\(Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon\\)</span> 给出。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\n\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\n\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-可证性\">9. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,m\">\\(\\pi,m\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(m-1)=A\">\\(\\pi(m-1)=A\\)</span>。定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_\\varepsilon=\\{A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon:\\varnothing\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_\\varepsilon=\\{A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon:\\varnothing\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标差异条款\">10. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标特征数据定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\bigl(EpsTerm_\\varepsilon,\\ Ax_\\varepsilon,\\ Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\bigl(EpsTerm_\\varepsilon,\\ Ax_\\varepsilon,\\ Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"EpsTerm_\\varepsilon\">\\(EpsTerm_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 给出绑定 ε 项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_\\varepsilon\">\\(Ax_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 给出见证项公理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\">\\(Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\)</span> 给出 ε 项外延公理。定义目标差异谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_\\varepsilon\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\bigl(EpsTerm_\\varepsilon,Ax_\\varepsilon,Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\bigr)\n\\land\nAx_\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\subseteq Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\varepsilon\\,\\forall A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\exists m&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\land\\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\n\\land\\pi(m-1)=A\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_\\varepsilon\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon\n=\n\\bigl(EpsTerm_\\varepsilon,Ax_\\varepsilon,Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\bigr)\n\\land\nAx_\\varepsilon\\cup Ax_{\\varepsilon ext}\\subseteq Ax_{Hilb\\varepsilon}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_\\varepsilon\\,\\forall A\\in Frm_\\varepsilon\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_\\varepsilon A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\exists m&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\land\\pi:m\\to Frm_\\varepsilon\n\\land\\pi(m-1)=A\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{HilbertEpsilon}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\varepsilon,\nFrm_\\varepsilon,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_T^\\varepsilon,\nBV_F^\\varepsilon,\nfresh,\nSub_T^\\varepsilon,\nSub_F^\\varepsilon,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon,\nEpsTerm_\\varepsilon,\nAx_{Hilb\\varepsilon},\nRule_\\to^\\varepsilon,\nRule_\\forall^\\varepsilon,\nRule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon},\n\\vdash_\\varepsilon,\nThm_\\varepsilon,\n\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon,\n\\Delta_\\varepsilon\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{HilbertEpsilon}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\varepsilon,\nFrm_\\varepsilon,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_T^\\varepsilon,\nBV_F^\\varepsilon,\nfresh,\nSub_T^\\varepsilon,\nSub_F^\\varepsilon,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\varepsilon,\nEpsTerm_\\varepsilon,\nAx_{Hilb\\varepsilon},\nRule_\\to^\\varepsilon,\nRule_\\forall^\\varepsilon,\nRule_\\alpha^\\varepsilon,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\varepsilon},\n\\vdash_\\varepsilon,\nThm_\\varepsilon,\n\\mathsf{Feature}_\\varepsilon,\n\\Delta_\\varepsilon\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 ε 绑定项、无捕获替换、ε 公理、外延 ε 公理和 Hilbert 型证明；不含选择函数模型、外部模型论构造或评价函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式的同时形成","text":"2. 项与公式的同时形成","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量","text":"3. 自由变量","level":1},{"id":"4.-无捕获替换","text":"4. 无捕获替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-alpha-等价","text":"5. alpha 等价","level":1},{"id":"6.-逻辑与等词公理","text":"6. 逻辑与等词公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-ε-公理集合","text":"7. ε 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-规则与证明","text":"8. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"9.-可证性","text":"9. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标差异条款","text":"10. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)","display":true},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R: